# Maintainer: QMKUI maintainers
pkgname=qmkui
pkgver=0.1.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Device-first QMK/VIA keyboard reader and project workbench"
arch=("x86_64")
url="https://github.com/Cordtus/qmkui"
license=("MIT")
depends=(
  "qmk"
  "hidapi"
  "webkit2gtk-4.1"
  "gtk3"
  "librsvg"
)
makedepends=(
  "cargo"
)
source=()
sha256sums=()

_local_source="${QMKUI_SOURCE_DIR:-$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/../../.." && pwd)}"

pkgver() {
  cd "$_local_source"
  printf "0.1.0.r%s" "$(git rev-list --count HEAD 2>/dev/null || printf 0)"
}

build() {
  cd "$_local_source"
  cargo build --release -p qmkui
}

package() {
  cd "$_local_source"
  install -Dm755 target/release/qmkui "$pkgdir/usr/bin/qmkui"
  install -Dm644 packaging/arch/qmkui/qmkui.desktop \
    "$pkgdir/usr/share/applications/qmkui.desktop"
  install -Dm644 packaging/arch/qmkui/qmkui.xml \
    "$pkgdir/usr/share/mime/packages/qmkui.xml"
  install -Dm644 packaging/arch/qmkui/qmkui.png \
    "$pkgdir/usr/share/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps/qmkui.png"
  install -Dm644 packaging/udev/70-qmkui.rules \
    "$pkgdir/usr/lib/udev/rules.d/70-qmkui.rules"
  install -Dm644 README.md "$pkgdir/usr/share/doc/qmkui/README.md"
  install -Dm644 CONTRIBUTING.md "$pkgdir/usr/share/doc/qmkui/CONTRIBUTING.md"
  install -Dm644 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md \
    "$pkgdir/usr/share/doc/qmkui/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md"
  install -Dm644 packaging/arch/qmkui/README.md \
    "$pkgdir/usr/share/doc/qmkui/gui-packaging.md"
  install -Dm644 LICENSE "$pkgdir/usr/share/licenses/qmkui/LICENSE"
}
